WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Look 1: a fixed overhead editorial frame holds the subject, walnut floor and Persian-inspired rug while a wooden fan rotates.

00:07.000 --> 00:14.000
Full occlusion transition 01: a fan blade passes over the torso and Look 2 appears without a camera change.

00:14.000 --> 00:21.000
Full occlusion transition 02: the same physical cover reveals Look 3; face, body position and light remain continuous.

00:21.000 --> 00:27.000
Full occlusion transition 03: a final blade sweep reveals Look 4 with the moving shadow still aligned.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.050
The fourth look holds for a final editorial beat; the locked top-down camera never moves.
